(• The perimeter did not disappear — it moved into the identity plane. Every request is now a negotiation between a verifiable subject and a verifiable resource, mediated by a control plane that never touches payload.) Tj
ET
Q
Q
q
q
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.796 0.835 0.882 rg
0.0840336134453782 0. 0. -0.0840336134453782 24.2016806722689068 187.7310924369747909 Tm
(• Security Governance is a PEER domain, not a final checklist. It consumes telemetry from the other five and pushes an optimized baseline back — that is the CMMI Level 5 "Optimizing" loop, made architectural.) Tj
ET
Q
Q
q
q
