/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.796 0.835 0.882 rg
0.0840336134453782 0. 0. -0.0840336134453782 24.2016806722689068 189.4117647058823763 Tm
(• Controls that don't fire are candidates for retirement. Every control carries a cost and an efficacy metric. That is how this architecture stays honest and how security theater dies.) Tj
ET
Q
Q
q
q
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.796 0.835 0.882 rg
0.0840336134453782 0. 0. -0.0840336134453782 24.2016806722689068 191.092436974789905 Tm
(• Zero Trust is not a product — it is a structural discipline. The Control Plane / Data Plane split, the short-lived credentials, the signed artifacts, the append-only audit anchor: these are the mechanical embodiments of "never trust, always verify.") Tj
ET
Q
Q
q
q
